5,0,1,talk,Servas,,Good morning. Let us begin this journey with open minds and hearts.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,"I prefer the quiet, but I am here. Let us see what unfolds.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Yumi,,Hi everyone! I'm so excited to meet you all. Let's have fun!,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Victoria,,I observe. Silence often speaks louder than words. Let us proceed.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,May,,Hello! I'm May. I hope we can all get along nicely today.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Servas,,Wisdom comes from listening. Who feels the most tension in the room?,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,I feel none. I am content to watch the dynamics play out.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Yumi,,I feel happy! Everyone seems nice so far. No tension here!,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Victoria,,"Tension is invisible. I see May smiling, but her eyes are sharp.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,May,,"Sharp? I'm just friendly! Victoria, you're being a bit intense.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Servas,,"Intensity can be a shield. May, do you trust your neighbors?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Jonathan,,"Trust is a complex concept. I trust the process, not people.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Yumi,,"I trust everyone! We're all friends, right? Let's stay positive.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Victoria,,"Friends? In this game, friends are the first to be accused.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,May,,"Wow, Victoria. Harsh. I just want to make sure we're safe.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Servas,,Safety is an illusion. We must find the truth. Goodnight.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Jonathan,,I will rest. The night will reveal what the day hides.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Yumi,,Goodnight! I hope we all sleep well and wake up safe.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,Victoria,,I will watch. The night is when the wolves hunt.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,May,,Goodnight. Let's hope for a peaceful night for everyone.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
