31,1,1,talk,Servas,,The night has passed. Who among us feels the weight of suspicion?,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"I feel the weight of your stares, Victoria. Why me?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I'm just happy to be alive! Who did you all suspect last night?,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I suspected May. Her charm is a mask. I checked Jonathan; he is human.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""May"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,May,,You checked Jonathan? And he's human? Then why are you looking at me?,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Servas,,"Victoria, if you are the Seer, your word carries weight. But prove it.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"I am human. I have no power. I am just a villager, I believe.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"If Victoria is the Seer, I trust her. May, you seem defensive.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Victoria,,I am the Seer. Jonathan is clean. May is the only one acting suspicious.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,May,,Suspicious? I'm just trying to keep the peace. You're paranoid.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Servas,,"Paranoia is a tool. May, if you are the wolf, you are cornered.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I agree with Victoria. May's behavior is inconsistent with a villager.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"I don't want to vote anyone out, but if May is the wolf...","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Victoria,,Vote May. She is the only threat. I have confirmed Jonathan is safe.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""May"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,May,,You all are ganging up on me. This is unfair. I'm a villager!,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Servas,,"The truth is in the numbers. If Victoria is right, May must go.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,I will vote for May. I trust Victoria's divination.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""May"",""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Yumi,,"I'm scared, but I'll follow the Seer. May, I'm sorry.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Victoria,,Do not be sorry. Protect the village. Vote May.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,May,,"Fine. If I'm out, you'll regret it. I was just being friendly.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
